ster":"Kenny","time":842510317,"body":"請給我你的 email address, 有事請教。","title":"search lilia","id":1357,]),(["poster":"Lilia","time":842513706,"body":"On Thu Sep 12, Kenny wrote:> 請給我你的 email address, 有事請教。athena@cs.nthu.edu.tw 有 quota 限制所以請不要灌太用力 :pathena@news.ee.nthu.edu.tw or athena@bbs.ee.nthu.edu.tw這兩個沒有 quota 限制，可以用力灌，不過我比較少看就是了 :p由於接很多 mail list 的關係，所以我的信箱都不設 .forward 的，therefore ...			Lilia the Queen stands here.","title":"Re: search lilia","id":1358,]),(["poster":"Smore","time":842657151,"body":"	as title ....	所以決定渡假幾天 ....						Smore","title":"心情惡劣....","id":1360,]),(["poster":"Tsunami","time":842661505,"title":"ftp 140.113.166.36 8008不能用..","body":"  as the title.    anyone knows what's going on?","id":1361,]),(["poster":"Yueh","time":842693878,"body":"hi!   ES所在的機器coral現在急須網路高手幫忙看看保全問題，請Lilia能不能跟kenny約個時間去他們實驗室看看機器，看看有沒有什麼安全上的漏洞或是有什麼防護措施可以做的。給些建議或是協助他們，當面講比mail來mail去有效多了。Lilia，我們都靠你了:p 現在ES等於是停頓狀態:(~~。post 在這裡，順便讓大家知道ES的現狀，也請大家多多給Lilia鼓勵:pYueh","title":"向lilia求救....","id":1362,]),(["poster":"Lilia","time":842704058,"title":"The steps","body":"1. Install SunOS 4.1.42. remove ALL services in /etc/inetd.conf   you may remove the network cable if you wish3. rebuild kernel if you like4. upgrade system to C2 level, see reference manual5. install SNP ptelnet on port 236. install tcp-wrapper & identd7. if no one need mail, get rid of sendmail8. install wu-ftpd9. remount mudlib, reopenThat's the abstract. I am not going to do this myself 'cause this processspends me up to two or three more workdays. However, I'm working in ITRInow and can't afford so much time. In fact, if using the above configurationand ES is still cracked, then we get into a mess shit.If the root of coral needs 8lgm advisory or something else, you may contactme. If you guys wanna to catch the cracker, log every packet to coral andfilter the from IP address, and then catch catch catch.Just remember one thing: IF YOU DON'T WANT TO BE CRACKED, CLOSE THE PORTSand OPEN PORTS WHICH IS BADLY NEEDED.I'll try to hack coral after the process listed above completed, 'cause cracking a site needs only TWO HOURS!! If the site is secure, then just reopen ES. Yes, I said it, reopen.*NOTE* If you use ptelnet, the usrname can't exceed 7 chars, or it will be       unsecured.			Lilia the Queen stands here.Sorry to waste all of your time. *bow*","id":1363,"locked":"yueh",]),(["poster":"Yueh","time":842734557,"body":"    謝謝Lilia, 專家出馬果然是不一樣。Kenny看樣子你有得忙了:p  Kenny加油:)  Yueh","title":"Re: The steps","id":1364,]),(["poster":"Stasia","time":842761012,"title":"???","body":"   我同學跟我說....昨天晚上有看到有五個player在線上..     不知道是他眼花了....還是......???     我查/log都沒有查到有任何player login的資料啊..     另外....昨天有人嘗試從我的工作站crack我...     .......這是什麼世界.......:<","id":1365,]),(["poster":"Kenny","time":842773781,"body":"On Sun Sep 15, Stasia wrote:>    我同學跟我說....昨天晚上有看到有五個player在線上..>      不知道是他眼花了....還是......???>      我查/log都沒有查到有任何player login的資料啊..>      另外....昨天有人嘗試從我的工作站crack我...>      .......這是什麼世界.......:<昨天是有幾個玩家到lab玩es，之前我不會用su，就開wizlock二分鐘給他們  login，之後全是用 su 的，log該有些記錄，這事yueh也大概知道一些，另  外你被hack之事，我也只能說：可憐…","title":"Re: ???","id":1366,]),(["poster":"Lilia","time":842788024,"title":"Re: ???","body":"On Sun Sep 15, Stasia wrote:>    我同學跟我說....昨天晚上有看到有五個player在線上..>      不知道是他眼花了....還是......???>      我查/log都沒有查到有任何player login的資料啊..>      另外....昨天有人嘗試從我的工作站crack我...>      .......這是什麼世界.......:<你沒眼花，我在線上看他們玩玩的很快樂。愛人送的衣服被偷了，心情很惡劣，我想小雅你不會比我更倒楣吧！","id":1367,]),(["poster":"Lilia","time":842788482,"title":"additional notes to The Steps","body":"1. SunOS 4.1.4 並非完全 secure，所以上 C2 前看清楚 nctuccca 裡的   CERT 文件，再依照順序一個一個地把 patch 補上。2. 如果真的得裝 sendmail，能裝多新版就裝多新版吧！3. syslogd 有個非常之大的洞 (SunOS libc 的 undocumented hole，你說賤不   賤?)，所以記得修改 sendmail，叫 sendmail 在送信失敗的時候，只要 log   有人 try 的訊息，不要把 mail body 送給 syslogd (好像新版的會 patch)4. 該做的做完，該補的補完，所有的使用者通通得換 id 和 password。   如果這樣還被破站的話，倒站算了 .... 唉 ....5. 拿不到 8lgm 再跟我說，應該用 yahoo search 一下就可以找到了。Good luck!			Lilia the Queen stands here.","id":1368,"locked":"yueh",]),(["poster":"Tsunami","time":842965686,"title":"island的整備工作..","body":"   Dear Gods :      island的整備工作大致已經完成了, explore共12個, 清單在   /d/island/adm/EXPLRE中, 遵照noden的格式做的;      另quest共有四個, 2個在forest, hole和samurai中各1個,       /d/island/forest/部份,      (1). 幫sasami找回寵物,for low level (1 - 5);      (2). 幫aiga尋回龍皇種子, for low level (1 - 5);    /d/island/hole/部份,      (1). 幫蜥蜴人勇士解決吸血鬼任務, for high level(above 15)            p.s maybe need party to solve.....:P    /d/island/samurai/部份,    (1). 幫calford送雕像給nakoruru, for low level(1 - 5),    其餘eq的整備工作將會繼續, 請大神有空時幫我備份, 免得.....:~~~~~~~    Best Regards.                                  Tsunami  P.S  這些quest仍有待q.c   ","id":1369,]),(["poster":"Smore","time":843015082,"title":"about backstab","body":"	about backstab + stick tape 應該是休好了 ....	(修... 不是休)	以後背刺在等待中的時候會多一個 temp \"doing_backstab\" 	如果要寫會讓 mob block_command 的物件請參考使用....	有 bug 的話請跟我講一下 ...	沒有的話過一段時間就應該可以開放 tape 了 ....				Smore","id":1370,]),(["poster":"Ethel","time":843032194,"body":"苗栗頭份 90733 附 750 號信箱  陳毅陵大家請多多寫信給他吧... :P					Ethel 代 post... :P","title":"redheart 的信箱","id":1371,]),(["poster":"Stasia","time":843032864,"body":"冒險者公會地下室那間....我早上進去時有些問題...第一次進去是根本進不去.....第二次才進去了...但是look ball看不到quest列表.....看到第四次才看到quest列表......似乎不太穩....請檢查一下.....:>","title":"冒險者公會B1...","id":1372,]),(["poster":"Smore","time":843061573,"title":"caesar ....","body":"	他的檔案好像有問題 ....	請大神看看....	謝謝 ...				Smorew				Smore....*sob*","id":1373,]),(["poster":"Yueh","time":843104768,"body":"hi! all     ES關了十幾天了，我想下週到九月底前reopen  。雖然還不能保證安全，但是拖太久也不是很好。  。reopen會砍掉所有玩家檔案，因為可能有玩家被改成有巫師的權利。  另外希望所有巫師都能更換密碼。  一些正在修改的部分，希望大家加快速度，儘速完成。     大家辛苦了:)  Yueh","title":"about reopen","id":1374,]),})
